---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="T-Time Media — Stories, media and apps"
  description="T-Time Media is an independent studio making original media and iOS apps across culture, identity, lifestyle, and community."
  ogPath=""
>
  <Header home />

  <!-- ================= ABOUT ================= -->
  <section id="about">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>What this is</h2>
      <div class="two-col">
        <div>
          <p class="lede">T-Time Media is an independent studio making original media and apps across culture, identity, lifestyle, and community.</p>
          <p class="fineprint">Founded by Dominic Anthony Pérignon. Every series, partner project, and app is its own standalone project under T-Time Media LLC.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p>We make original series, branded content, and social-first media. We also design and build iOS apps. Whatever the format or platform, we keep the people at the center of the story in view.</p>
          <p>T-Time Series, our flagship series, is about transgender men and transmasculine people — our lives and our history. That includes men who've medically transitioned and men who haven't, men who "pass" and men who don't, binary and nonbinary transmasculine people alike — T-Time Series isn't defining who counts.</p>
          <p>Prism, our first iOS app, is a personal companion for tracking your care and your journey in your own private place.</p>

          <!-- Verified figure. Re-check before launch; swap freely. -->
          <div class="figure">
            <span class="big">In the 2024–25 U.S. television season, 7 of 33 transgender characters were trans men. None were gay trans men.</span>
            <cite>GLAAD, <em>Where We Are on TV</em>, 2024–25 season</cite>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= WORK ================= -->
  <section id="work">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>The work</h2>
      <div class="work">
        <a class="card" href="https://www.instagram.com/ttimemedia/">
          <span class="seg">Original series</span>
          <p class="t">T-Time Series</p>
          <p class="d">Our flagship: transgender men and transmasculine people — our lives and our history.</p>
          <span class="go">Follow on Instagram →</span>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="#press">
          <span class="seg">Partner work</span>
          <p class="t">Branded &amp; partner projects</p>
          <p class="d">Interviews, branded content, and social-first media, made with partners who want it done with care.</p>
          <span class="go">Work with us →</span>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="/prism">
          <span class="seg">iOS app</span>
          <p class="t">Prism</p>
          <p class="d">A personal companion for tracking your care and your journey: medications, appointments, milestones, and a journal. In testing.</p>
          <span class="go">Learn more →</span>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="/be-in-it">
          <span class="seg">Get involved</span>
          <p class="t">Be in it</p>
          <p class="d">Trans men and transmasculine people: be featured in a portrait, an interview, or a story in your own words.</p>
          <span class="go">Share your story →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= MEET THE CREATOR ================= -->
  <section id="creator">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Meet the creator</h2>
      <div class="two-col">
        <div>
          <div class="creator-photo"><img src="/creator.jpg" alt="Dominic Anthony Pérignon, founder of T-Time Media"></div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="creator-name">Dominic Anthony Pérignon</p>
          <p class="creator-role">Founder, T-Time Media · Storyteller · Entrepreneur · Developer</p>
          <p>Dominic Anthony Pérignon is the founder and creative force behind T-Time Media, a studio built around culture, identity, lifestyle, and community. He's a journalist and storyteller who got his start covering the lived experiences of transgender men — work that grew into T-Time Media's slate of original series and partner projects.</p>
          <p>He's also a creator who codes: he designs and builds T-Time Media's iOS apps himself, starting with Prism. Whether it's a story or an app, his work is rooted in the belief that the people at the center of a story deserve to be represented not just as subjects of debate, but as people with histories, experiences, voices, creativity, and stories worth documenting.</p>

          <div class="figure">
            <span class="big">"I started T-Time because trans men's stories were missing — from mainstream LGBTQ+ conversations, media coverage, even our own community spaces. I wanted to put us at the center: to document our history, amplify our voices, and create a place where trans men can finally see themselves reflected."</span>
            <cite>— Dominic, on why he started T-Time Series</cite>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= NEWSLETTER ================= -->
  <section id="newsletter">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Newsletter</h2>
      <div class="two-col">
        <div>
          <p class="lede">Social platforms can disappear. Email doesn't.</p>
          <p class="fineprint">Stories, sourcing, and the parts that don't fit in a caption. Roughly monthly.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div data-fs-success style="display: none; padding: 12px 16px; background: #d4edda; border: 1px solid #c3e6cb; border-radius: 2px; color: #155724; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 15px;">
            ✓ Thanks for subscribing! Check your email to confirm.
          </div>
          <div data-fs-error style="display: none; padding: 12px 16px; background: #f8d7da; border: 1px solid #f5c6cb; border-radius: 2px; color: #721c24; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 15px;"></div>

          <form id="newsletter-form" data-fs-frm>
            <div class="form-row">
              <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="What should I call you?" aria-label="Name" data-fs-field>
              <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email" aria-label="Email" required data-fs-field>
              <button class="btn" type="submit" data-fs-submit-btn>Subscribe</button>
            </div>
          </form>
          <p class="fineprint" style="margin-top:16px;">No spam. No list sharing, ever. Unsubscribe in one click.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= PRESS ================= -->
  <section id="press">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Press &amp; contact</h2>
      <p class="press-email"><a href="mailto:hello@ttimemedia.org">hello@ttimemedia.org</a></p>
      <div class="contact-grid">
        <div>
          <h3>Press &amp; interviews</h3>
          <p>Available for comment on trans men's representation in media, and on coverage practices.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Pitches &amp; collaboration</h3>
          <p>Story tips, guest segments, and partnership inquiries, for media or apps.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Corrections</h3>
          <p>If something here is wrong, tell me and I'll fix it and say what changed.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />

  <!-- Formspree AJAX Integration - Newsletter Form -->
  <script is:inline>
    window.formspree = window.formspree || function () { (formspree.q = formspree.q || []).push(arguments); };
    formspree('initForm', { formElement: '#newsletter-form', formId: 'xljroega', successRedirect: 'https://www.ttimemedia.org/subscribed' });
  </script>
  <script is:inline src="https://unpkg.com/@formspree/ajax@1" defer></script>
</Layout>
